[["heading","SECTION 23 / VISUAL TEACHING EDITION"],["heading","SOFTWARE ENGINEERING INTERNSHIP\nAuthentication &\nApplication Security"],["text","Complete visual teaching edition"],["sinhala","","සරල English සහ සිංහල පැහැදිලි කිරීම් සමඟ security fundamentals ඉJගෙන",459],["sinhala","","ගෙනිමු.",38],["heading","23"],["heading","23"],["heading","46"],["text","Original topics"],["text","Additional topics"],["text","Total lessons"],["heading","How to study"],["sinhala","","මුලින් definition එක කියවන්න. Diagram එJකේ flow එක Jතේරැම් ගෙන්න. ඊට පසු code example එක",491],["sinhala","","සහ expected result එක බලලා interview answer එක තමන්Jගේ වචන වලින් කියන්න.",426],["heading","User credentials\nIdentity verified\nPermission check\nAllow or deny"],["text","Request / decision / result"],["heading","Scope and conventions"],["text","Lessons 1–23 follow the original internship checklist. Lessons 24–31 retain the earlier study-guide\nadditions. Lessons 32–46 extend the syllabus for defensive full-stack development. Examples use\nJavaScript/Node.js, Express, SQL or conceptual library calls. Snippets are illustrative and require\napplication-specific configuration, trusted libraries and tests; they are not a ready-to-deploy security\nsystem."],["text","OWASP Top 10:2025 awareness is included. Source and further reading links appear at the end."]]